1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,080
My name is Victor.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:04,780
Hi.

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:07,570
And you are?

4
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:10,310
You are Frank.

5
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,650
You are so much more than just a sheep,
aren't you?

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,220
Yeah.

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,980
How would you know?

8
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,460
Look at you, you're an adventurer, Frank.

9
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:28,630
Just like me, you're a lone wolf.

10
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:33,670
Tell me, does one choose to be alone?

11
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,050
No, one doesn't.

12
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,960
One doesn't even choose to be a wolf.

13
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,600
Or does one?

14
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:50,570
Oh, Mr. Hector.

15
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:51,700
Victor, Victor.

16
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,380
I don't know what you're on about,

17
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:57,150
but I'm just a sheep minding its own
business.

18
00:00:58,370 --> 00:01:00,700
And I suggest you do the same.

19
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,780
No, no, no, no, Frank, wait, wait, wait.

20
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:06,340
No, this is not the way.

21
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:09,270
Just give me one minute of your precious
time.

22
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:11,930
Precious time?

23
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:15,500
Yeah, just give me one minute.

24
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,040
You would have one more minute, wouldn't
you?
